{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-strategies-comparison","title":"渲染策略对比与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-architecture-patterns/rendering-architecture/rendering-strategies-comparison","wordCount":1236,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"渲染策略对比与选型\">渲染策略对比与选型</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>现代前端应用的渲染策略不再是一个全局二选一的决定。2026 年的元框架（Next.js 16、Astro 6、SvelteKit 2）允许开发者在同一项目中按路由选择不同的渲染模式。理解每种策略的工作原理、性能特征和适用场景，是做出正确架构决策的前提。本文系统对比 CSR、SSR、SSG、ISR 四种核心渲染模式，并提供基于页面类型的混合策略决策框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"四种渲染模式的工作原理\">四种渲染模式的工作原理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Browser Request&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Rendering Strategy&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|CSR| C[&quot;Empty HTML + JS Bundle&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|SSR| D[&quot;Server renders HTML per request&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|SSG| E[&quot;Pre-built HTML from CDN&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|ISR| F[&quot;Cached HTML + background revalidation&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;Client hydration + render&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;Client hydration&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;Zero JS or selective hydration&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; J[&quot;Stale-while-revalidate&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Browser Request\"] --&gt; B{\"Rendering Strategy\"}\n    B --&gt;|CSR| C[\"Empty HTML + JS Bundle\"]\n    B --&gt;|SSR| D[\"Server renders HTML per request\"]\n    B --&gt;|SSG| E[\"Pre-built HTML from CDN\"]\n    B --&gt;|ISR| F[\"Cached HTML + background revalidation\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"Client hydration + render\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"Client hydration\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"Zero JS or selective hydration\"]\n    F --&gt; J[\"Stale-while-revalidate\"]</pre><p><strong>CSR（Client-Side Rendering）</strong> 服务器返回一个空白 HTML 壳和 JavaScript 打包文件，所有页面内容由浏览器执行 JS 后动态生成。典型实现包括 Create React App 和 Vite + React。</p>\n<p><strong>SSR（Server-Side Rendering）</strong> 每次请求到达时，服务器实时执行 React/Vue 组件，生成完整 HTML 返回给浏览器。客户端再通过 hydration 附加事件监听器。</p>\n<p><strong>SSG（Static Site Generation）</strong> 在构建阶段预渲染所有页面为静态 HTML 文件，部署到 CDN 后无需服务器计算。适合内容变化频率低的页面。</p>\n<p><strong>ISR（Incremental Static Regeneration）</strong> 结合 SSG 的 CDN 性能优势和 SSR 的数据新鲜度。首次访问返回缓存的静态 HTML，同时在后台触发重新生成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"性能指标对比\">性能指标对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>CSR</th>\n<th>SSR</th>\n<th>SSG</th>\n<th>ISR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FCP (First Contentful Paint)</td>\n<td>慢 (1.5-3s)</td>\n<td>快 (0.5-1s)</td>\n<td>最快 (0.3-0.6s)</td>\n<td>快 (0.3-0.8s)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCP (Largest Contentful Paint)</td>\n<td>慢 (2-4s)</td>\n<td>中 (1-2s)</td>\n<td>快 (0.5-1s)</td>\n<td>快 (0.5-1.2s)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INP (Interaction to Next Paint)</td>\n<td>快 (hydration 后)</td>\n<td>中 (hydration 延迟)</td>\n<td>快 (minimal JS)</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTFB (Time to First Byte)</td>\n<td>快 (空 HTML)</td>\n<td>慢 (服务器计算)</td>\n<td>最快 (CDN)</td>\n<td>快 (CDN 缓存)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS Bundle Size</td>\n<td>大 (全量)</td>\n<td>中 (hydration)</td>\n<td>小 (可选)</td>\n<td>小-中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEO</td>\n<td>差 (需 JS 执行)</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"流式-ssr-与-partial-prerendering\">流式 SSR 与 Partial Prerendering</h3><p>Next.js 16 引入的 Partial Prerendering (PPR) 代表了 SSR 的最新演进。PPR 将页面分为静态壳（从 CDN 即时响应）和动态区域（流式传输填充），兼顾了 SSG 的速度和 SSR 的动态能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Next.js 16 - Partial Prerendering&#10;// 静态壳即时响应，动态区域流式填充&#10;import { Suspense } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;import { ProductInfo } from &#39;./ProductInfo&#39;; // Server Component&#10;import { PersonalizedRecommendations } from &#39;./Recommendations&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function ProductPage({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;main&gt;&#10;      {/* 静态壳 - 从 CDN 即时响应 */}&#10;      &lt;header&gt;Product Details&lt;/header&gt;&#10;&#10;      {/* 动态区域 - 流式传输 */}&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ProductSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;ProductInfo id={params.id} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      {/* 个性化区域 - 延迟流式 */}&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;RecommendationsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;PersonalizedRecommendations userId={params.id} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/main&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Next.js 16 - Partial Prerendering</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 静态壳即时响应，动态区域流式填充</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Suspense } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ProductInfo } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './ProductInfo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Server Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PersonalizedRecommendations } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './Recommendations'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 静态壳 - 从 CDN 即时响应 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>Product Details</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">header</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 动态区域 - 流式传输 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;ProductSkeleton />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ProductInfo id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{params.id} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 个性化区域 - 延迟流式 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense fallback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{&#x3C;RecommendationsSkeleton />}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PersonalizedRecommendations userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{params.id} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Suspense</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">main</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"基于页面类型的策略选择\">基于页面类型的策略选择</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Page Type Analysis&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Needs real-time data?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|Yes| C{&quot;Needs SEO?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|No| D{&quot;Content changes frequently?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|Yes| E[&quot;SSR with Streaming&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|No| F[&quot;CSR&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| G[&quot;ISR&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|No| H[&quot;SSG&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Page Type Analysis\"] --&gt; B{\"Needs real-time data?\"}\n    B --&gt;|Yes| C{\"Needs SEO?\"}\n    B --&gt;|No| D{\"Content changes frequently?\"}\n    C --&gt;|Yes| E[\"SSR with Streaming\"]\n    C --&gt;|No| F[\"CSR\"]\n    D --&gt;|Yes| G[\"ISR\"]\n    D --&gt;|No| H[\"SSG\"]</pre><p><strong>营销/着陆页</strong> → SSG。内容由市场团队在 CMS 中维护，更新频率以天计。纯静态部署到 CDN，Lighthouse 分数稳定 95+。</p>\n<p><strong>电商产品页</strong> → ISR (revalidate: 60s)。产品信息更新频率适中，库存状态可通过客户端 API 实时获取。</p>\n<p><strong>用户仪表盘</strong> → CSR。完全个性化的数据，不需要 SEO，交互密集。认证后加载。</p>\n<p><strong>搜索结果页</strong> → SSR with Streaming。每次请求数据不同，需要 SEO 收录，流式传输避免长时间白屏。</p>\n<p><strong>博客/文档</strong> → SSG + Islands。内容几乎不变，局部交互（搜索框、代码复制）通过 Islands 注入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"next-js-16-混合渲染配置\">Next.js 16 混合渲染配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx - SSG&#10;export async function generateStaticParams() {&#10;  const posts = await getAllPosts();&#10;  return posts.map((post) =&gt; ({ slug: post.slug }));&#10;}&#10;&#10;// app/dashboard/page.tsx - CSR (client component)&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;export default function Dashboard() {&#10;  const { data } = useSWR(&#39;/api/dashboard&#39;, fetcher);&#10;  return &lt;DashboardView data={data} /&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// app/products/[id]/page.tsx - ISR&#10;export const revalidate = 60; // 60秒后重新验证&#10;&#10;export default async function ProductPage({ params }: Props) {&#10;  const product = await getProduct(params.id);&#10;  return &lt;ProductDetail product={product} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx - SSG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generateStaticParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> posts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getAllPosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> posts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ slug: post.slug }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/dashboard/page.tsx - CSR (client component)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useSWR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/dashboard'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, fetcher);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DashboardView</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/products/[id]/page.tsx - ISR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> revalidate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 60秒后重新验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Props</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProductDetail</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">={</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"astro-混合渲染配置\">Astro 混合渲染配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// astro.config.mjs&#10;import { defineConfig } from &#39;astro/config&#39;;&#10;import react from &#39;@astrojs/react&#39;;&#10;import node from &#39;@astrojs/node&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  output: &#39;hybrid&#39;, // 默认 SSG，按需开启 SSR&#10;  adapter: node({ mode: &#39;standalone&#39; }),&#10;  integrations: [react()],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// src/pages/blog/[slug].astro - SSG (默认)&#10;---&#10;export async function getStaticPaths() {&#10;  const posts = await getCollection(&#39;blog&#39;);&#10;  return posts.map(post =&gt; ({&#10;    params: { slug: post.slug },&#10;    props: { post },&#10;  }));&#10;}&#10;const { post } = Astro.props;&#10;---&#10;&lt;BlogLayout&gt;&#10;  &lt;article set:html={post.body} /&gt;&#10;&lt;/BlogLayout&gt;&#10;&#10;// src/pages/search.astro - SSR (按需)&#10;export const prerender = false; // 标记为 SSR&#10;---&#10;const query = Astro.url.searchParams.get(&#39;q&#39;);&#10;const results = await searchAPI(query);&#10;---&#10;&lt;SearchResults results={results} /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// astro.config.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'astro/config'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> react </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@astrojs/react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@astrojs/node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hybrid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认 SSG，按需开启 SSR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span sty